<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Assemble weapons which utilize electromagnets to catapult sabots up to hypervelocity, penetrating thick armor and piercing through targets alike. Note that these also require advanced components.-->
  <VWE_MassDrivers.description>组装武器，利用电磁体将弹射器弹射到超高速，穿透厚厚的装甲并刺穿穿过目标。请注意，这些也需要高级组件。</VWE_MassDrivers.description>
  <VWE_MassDrivers.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->velocity as a weapon-->
    <li>subject-&gt;速度作为武器</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->mastered the physics of electromagnetic acceleration, creating weapons that launch projectiles at staggering speeds-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;掌握了电磁加速物理学，制造出以惊人速度发射射弹的武器</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->engineered mass drivers capable of breaching the most formidable armor, reshaping the principles of warfare and defense-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;精心设计的大规模驱动器能够突破最强大的装甲，重塑战争和防御的原则</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->unveiled a new era where kinetic energy defines the cutting edge of military technology-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;开启了一个新时代，动能定义了军事技术的前沿</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->harnessing the unstoppable force of hypervelocity for unmatched offensive capability-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;利用不可阻挡的超高速力量实现无与伦比的进攻能力</li>
  </VWE_MassDrivers.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: mass drivers-->
  <VWE_MassDrivers.label>大众司机</VWE_MassDrivers.label>
